## Usage from other packages

Other workbench tools that depend on `chumicro-{name}` can import the fakes directly:

```python
from {import_name}.testing import Fake...
```

Workbench tools that expose injectable services ship their own test fakes alongside the production code, so every consumer uses the same shared fake.

